/-!
# A390946

Irregular triangle read by rows of continued fraction expansions of prime(i)/prime(j+1) for j >= 1, 1 <= i < j.

The 88 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A390946

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2, 2,
    3, 1, 2, 2, 5, 2, 3, 1, 2, 2,
    5, 1, 1, 1, 3, 6, 2, 4, 3, 2,
